00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:26.260
And try and control your appetite until I have finished.

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:28.760
I do not want to compete for your attention with a sandwich.

00:20:31.050 --> 00:20:38.950
Now, listen to me. We can't be certain, of course, that our connection with the disappearances of Mr. Withers will never come to the attention of the police.

00:20:39.360 --> 00:20:41.440
We must be prepared for any such contingency.

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:46.700
So, in case we have a question in the matter, this is what has happened.

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:50.300
George and I went down to the stables to shoot a rat.

00:20:50.740 --> 00:20:53.600
It was a nuisance in the rain, but Millicent insisted.

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:56.060
Afraid of rats?

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:58.240
Well, you are now.

00:20:58.720 --> 00:20:59.980
Now, we were surprised...

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:03.600
I was surprised to find our friend, Captain Smollett, waiting in the stables.

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:07.220
Now, you'll recall that the first time he was here was before Jane served tea.

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:09.900
So, she didn't know that he was here at that time.

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:12.240
That's right. She didn't see him.

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:17.800
Now, Smollett explained that he was in the stables because she ducked in to avoid a particularly heavy shower.

00:21:18.300 --> 00:21:21.010
So, naturally, we brought him to the house for tea. You understand?

00:21:21.850 --> 00:21:22.790
Oh, yes, of course, dear.

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:26.000
I know they'll come! I know they will! They'll find it!

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:29.760
If you can't control yourself until I have finished, I shan't allow you to have any more tea.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:36.280
I say, you certainly have taken care of things neatly.

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:37.370
That's right, what?

00:21:37.570 --> 00:21:39.210
Yes, he is thorough, isn't he?

00:21:39.430 --> 00:21:40.550
He hasn't overlooked a thing.

00:21:40.830 --> 00:21:41.350
You think so?

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:47.350
It's fortunate we don't have to depend upon you for our security, I must say.

00:21:47.670 --> 00:21:49.390
But I don't see I could be any neater.

00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:53.170
I mean, Smolt will never tell himself, that's certain enough.

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:57.840
But even if they do find the cadaver is discovered sometime.

00:21:58.280 --> 00:21:59.820
If it is discovered.

00:22:00.220 --> 00:22:05.640
You see, leaving things to chance, pure chance, the same sloppy approach that you've always had, George.

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:09.190
Supposing Smollett were away when it was discovered.

00:22:10.090 --> 00:22:11.690
Supposing he had skipped the country.

00:22:12.100 --> 00:22:14.990
Oh, well, I don't think he'd do a thing like that.

00:22:15.300 --> 00:22:17.840
Probably not. Not enough imagination, I dare say.

00:22:18.640 --> 00:22:21.160
But I don't intend to take a chance on any such thing.

00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:26.230
That is a careless, slovenly way of doing things with which I have no patience.

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:27.970
But dear, what else can you do?

00:22:28.230 --> 00:22:29.250
Now listen closely.

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:36.400
and remember just a moment ago after captain smollett left we went back to the stable to shoot

00:22:36.400 --> 00:22:44.140
the rat we noticed the cover to the sewer was somewhat ajar and as you george lifted it into

00:22:44.140 --> 00:22:53.950
place i glanced in and made a ghastly discovery now is that perfectly clear yes but i don't

00:22:54.310 --> 00:22:59.620
Well, give me the police station about it, she'll bleed quickly.

00:23:04.060 --> 00:23:04.840
Oh, is that the police station?

00:23:05.670 --> 00:23:08.350
Oh, this is Mr. Princey of Abbott's Loxton.

00:23:09.500 --> 00:23:11.020
I'm afraid something rather terrible has happened.

00:23:11.760 --> 00:23:13.160
You send somebody up here at once, please.

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:22.010
I believe that should cover everything.

00:23:22.410 --> 00:23:25.560
I hope you'll let this be an example to you, my boy.

00:23:26.200 --> 00:23:29.510
It's a rare problem that won't yield to a little thought and patience.

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.780
But we must be very careful never to leave any loose ends dangling.

00:23:35.520 --> 00:23:36.440
You see, that's the thing.

00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:38.500
A little tea, Mother, please.

00:23:41.960 --> 00:23:53.580
I presume that story was intended to illustrate that blood is thicker than water.

00:23:54.500 --> 00:23:59.970
I always find it heartwarming to see a family standing shoulder to shoulder in the...

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:04.770
face of adversity. Unfortunately, the authorities were not thrilled by this

00:24:04.770 --> 00:24:11.260
sight and were seen tossing about such phrases as obstructing justice, accessory

00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:17.200
after the fact, murder in the first degree. Very nasty. The princes received

00:24:17.200 --> 00:24:22.500
substantial sentences. You see, unfortunately, Captain Smollett didn't

00:24:22.500 --> 00:24:28.600
play the game. When the police arrived, he insisted on his innocence, thus

00:24:28.600 --> 00:24:29.960
That's confusing, poor Millicent.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:34.200
to such an extent that she re-enacted the crime with her father as the victim.

00:24:35.270 --> 00:24:36.650
Broke the croquet mally too.

00:24:37.760 --> 00:24:38.980
I believe I'll have another.

00:24:48.560 --> 00:24:49.280
More vermouth.

00:24:49.680 --> 00:24:57.040
Oh well, I still have plenty of olives.

00:25:05.530 --> 00:25:06.970
That was exceedingly dry.

00:25:07.990 --> 00:25:11.030
Next week, we shall be back at the same old stand.

00:25:12.260 --> 00:25:13.940
Please drop in again.

00:25:14.780 --> 00:25:15.120
Good night.
